{"ID":"20230928082634-lqw70me","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230928082634-lqw70me","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928082634-lqw70me\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928082637-kfnve0v\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928082637-fj2i7wq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928082637-fj2i7wq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:22,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:22\u0026#125;","title":"【十天干】【五门十变】（本穴治疗）","type":"doc","updated":"20230928082809"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230928082637-kfnve0v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082637-kfnve0v","updated":"20230928082653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"甲（胆）\t乙（肝）\t\t丙（小肠）\t丁（心）\t \t戊（胃）"}]},{"ID":"20230928082637-6qrw3u8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082637-6qrw3u8","updated":"20230928082654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"己（脾）\t庚（大肠） \t辛（肺）\t\t壬（膀胱）\t葵（肾脏）"}]},{"ID":"20230928082637-c9r97e4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082637-c9r97e4","updated":"20230928082731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"土\t\t金\t\t\t水\t\t\t木\t\t\t火\t\t\t（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"木火土金水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）"}]},{"ID":"20230928082639-wqangs0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082639-wqangs0"}},{"ID":"20230928082637-7g7ekl8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082637-7g7ekl8","updated":"20230928082735"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"本穴："}]},{"ID":"20230928082637-eqe8f44","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082637-eqe8f44","updated":"20230928082747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胆（临泣）\t 肝（行间）\t小肠（阳谷）\t心（少府）\t胃（足三里）"}]},{"ID":"20230928082637-2thltrh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082637-2thltrh","updated":"20230928082748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脾（太白）\t大肠（二间）\t肺（经渠）\t膀胱（通谷）\t肾（阴谷穴）"}]},{"ID":"20230928082645-4b3o5i8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082645-4b3o5i8"}},{"ID":"20230928082637-9etkc5m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082637-9etkc5m","updated":"20230928082751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"本穴治疗：通过其他经本穴的补泻，对病灶所在经进行治疗作用；"}]},{"ID":"20230928082651-zisipdt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082651-zisipdt"}},{"ID":"20230928082637-r2gygn0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082637-r2gygn0","updated":"20230928082807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一：该经的本穴可以做子母经的补泻；"}]},{"ID":"20230928082637-xon4xak","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082637-xon4xak","updated":"20230928082807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二：上下两穴叠加可以强化五行的力量，如胆（临泣）+脾（太白）可以强土；"}]},{"ID":"20230928082637-fj2i7wq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082637-fj2i7wq","updated":"20230928082809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"思路：肝（木）有问题时，要先强土如扎临泣+太白，因为木克土，首先强土实脾，实脾后再强水如阳谷+经渠，因为水生木；"}]}]}